There needs to be more lore.

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:21.200
Yeah, there needs to be more lore because the story in the manual was lackluster.

00:24:21.380 --> 00:24:23.920
But there is some interesting thing here, Sean.

00:24:24.060 --> 00:24:26.640
So you kill Bigfoot.

00:24:26.800 --> 00:24:29.000
