But they could have went like full physics sandbox in the next one if it was snakes in space.

00:25:46.420 --> 00:25:49.300
Yeah. I mean they had a underwater level in this one.

00:25:49.680 --> 00:25:55.800
They did. I didn't get to it so I don't know exactly how it controls but I saw it in the video.

00:25:56.100 --> 00:25:57.400
