00:25:57.880 --> 00:26:04.160
And it's like 20 minutes into the 30 minute like full playthrough so it's pretty far into the game.

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:12.960
Well, it does control completely different because now you have the ability to kind of like swim up and fall back down.

00:26:14.180 --> 00:26:16.480
