00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:23.140
It's the most different level I think in terms of like it's most uniquely it's the most unique feeling level.

00:26:23.800 --> 00:26:31.680
Yeah. But so there was no snakes in space but there was a Game Boy sequel titled, you guessed it, Sneaky Snakes.

00:26:32.180 --> 00:26:33.420
Oh. That is what we guessed.

