00:26:37.860 --> 00:26:42.060
This just feels like such a wasted potential for IP.

00:26:42.640 --> 00:27:03.800
Like you got these like actually, you know, they're simple but they are cute like characters and you've already got a goofy naming convention and you've already got weird theming with toilets and feet and a bunch of like, you know, kind of poop and fart stuff.

00:27:04.360 --> 00:27:12.740
You'd think that there would be like, you know, if not a story for this one game, you'd think that there'd be like some kind of design.

00:27:13.100 --> 00:27:19.160
It just seems like this was a prototype that they just had to think of some characters to put into it.

00:27:19.160 --> 00:27:29.240
In level seven of the NES version, the stage as a whole like spells out Nintendo Game Boy.

00:27:29.900 --> 00:27:33.900
But the snake rattle and roll also never came out on Game Boy.

