You don't have anything. Oh, you didn't have anything.

00:28:50.700 --> 00:28:57.300
No, no, no. I really did think that I did for a second and I feel very sad that I don't.

00:28:57.300 --> 00:28:59.060
Um... But the game...

00:28:59.500 --> 00:29:01.500
It's actually a very simple game.

00:29:01.940 --> 00:29:03.420
There's not much to talk about.

