00:29:50.800 --> 00:29:52.160
Uh... Maybe a little faster.

00:29:52.320 --> 00:29:54.460
Maybe if you like slowed it down, it would be Jaws theme.

00:29:55.020 --> 00:30:00.960
I'm rambling because a part of me feels a little conflicted about voting no.

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:04.320
But my heart right now says that's right.

00:30:04.840 --> 00:30:06.520
Uh... We got a fun game here.

00:30:06.860 --> 00:30:11.620
So it hurts to say that, like, oh, a fun game that people who like the NES might enjoy.

00:30:11.640 --> 00:30:14.980
Like, shouldn't that be what fits on the Essential Games list?

00:30:15.280 --> 00:30:17.160
But I don't know if there's...

00:30:17.160 --> 00:30:19.000
Hmm? Maybe there is enough here.

00:30:19.720 --> 00:30:23.100
Maybe I'm gonna just throw it on and let you two decide what happens next.

00:30:23.180 --> 00:30:27.600
I think I am gonna give Snake, Rattle, and Roll a little Essential Games list push here.

00:30:27.680 --> 00:30:34.140
And here's why. This game was the kind of game that, um, feels funny to control at first.

00:30:34.540 --> 00:30:36.840
And I think as you spend time with it...

00:30:36.840 --> 00:30:38.000
And I mean that.

00:30:38.100 --> 00:30:39.060
Spend time with it.

00:30:39.140 --> 00:30:40.180
Don't spend five minutes.

00:30:40.260 --> 00:30:45.560
You gotta spend some time. I think that the controls of the snakes only feel better as time goes on.

00:30:45.640 --> 00:30:47.840
They don't become more frustrating by any means.

00:30:48.000 --> 00:30:54.800
And once you get those controls down, what you have is a pretty standard 10-level game

00:30:54.800 --> 00:31:00.580
with some, you know, changes here and there so that the gameplay loop never gets too stale.

00:31:00.740 --> 00:31:04.660
But ultimately, it's a pretty fun, short-lived experience.

00:31:04.660 --> 00:31:08.340
It's harmless, uh, as a catalog entry.

00:31:08.520 --> 00:31:10.460
But it also kind of stands out.

00:31:10.740 --> 00:31:14.000
So, I think I am gonna put this on the Essential Games list.

00:31:14.220 --> 00:31:15.180
What about you, Sean?

00:31:16.800 --> 00:31:17.900
So, yeah.

00:31:18.040 --> 00:31:22.140
This is kind of a, uh, an odd game.

00:31:22.280 --> 00:31:24.460
Because one, it kind of came out of nowhere.

00:31:24.460 --> 00:31:26.120
At least from my perspective.

00:31:26.200 --> 00:31:28.360
Not really knowing anything about these games.

00:31:28.560 --> 00:31:31.240
And it had a pretty, like...

00:31:31.240 --> 00:31:37.820
When you see snake rattle and roll on a list of titles, it just doesn't really stand out.

00:31:38.020 --> 00:31:41.540
Um, aside from like, oh, that's probably gonna be pretty bad.

00:31:41.540 --> 00:31:55.740
