00:32:14.880 --> 00:32:19.040
And, uh, the weird decisions that...

00:32:19.720 --> 00:32:22.280
I just feel like this should have been bigger.

00:32:22.700 --> 00:32:23.820
Uh, so yeah.

00:32:23.940 --> 00:32:26.740
I, I think I, just by virtue of it being unique.

00:32:26.740 --> 00:32:30.860
