00:32:34.720 --> 00:32:37.260
That, like, I, I usually just complain.

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:38.900
And I did complain.

00:32:39.260 --> 00:32:41.880
But I did, I had less to complain about in this game.

00:32:42.080 --> 00:32:45.200
